---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';

const breadcrumbSchema = {
  "@context": "https://schema.org",
  "@type": "BreadcrumbList",
  "itemListElement": [
    { "@type": "ListItem", "position": 1, "name": "Home", "item": "https://www.mahindralifespaceshomes.in/" },
    { "@type": "ListItem", "position": 2, "name": "Research Hub", "item": "https://www.mahindralifespaceshomes.in/articles" },
    { "@type": "ListItem", "position": 3, "name": "Mahalunge Pin Code 411045 & Infrastructure Guide", "item": "https://www.mahindralifespaceshomes.in/articles/mahalunge-pin-code-connectivity-infrastructure-guide-2026" }
  ]
};

const articleSchema = {
  "@context": "https://schema.org",
  "@type": "Article",
  "headline": "Mahalunge Pune Pin Code 411045: Infrastructure, DP Roads & Metro Line 3 Connectivity Guide (2026)",
  "description": "Exhaustive infrastructure dossier on Mahalunge Pune Pin Code 411045, PMRDA 36m DP road, Hinjewadi-Mahalunge bridge, Metro Line 3 stations, and civic development status.",
  "author": {
    "@type": "Organization",
    "name": "Mahindra Lifespaces Mahalunge Research Desk"
  },
  "publisher": {
    "@type": "Organization",
    "name": "Mahindra Lifespaces Developers Ltd.",
    "logo": {
      "@type": "ImageObject",
      "url": "https://www.mahindralifespaceshomes.in/images/mahindra-lifespaces-logo.svg"
    }
  },
  "datePublished": "2026-09-10",
  "dateModified": "2026-09-10"
};

const pageSchema = {
  "@context": "https://schema.org",
  "@graph": [breadcrumbSchema, articleSchema]
};
---

<Layout
  title="Mahalunge Pune Pin Code 411045: Infrastructure & Metro Connectivity Guide 2026"
  description="All about Mahalunge Pune 411045: PMRDA 36m DP road network, Hinjewadi Phase 1 bridge, Pune Metro Line 3, and Mahindra's 13.46-acre development location."
  canonical="https://www.mahindralifespaceshomes.in/articles/mahalunge-pin-code-connectivity-infrastructure-guide-2026"
  customSchema={pageSchema}
>
  <article class="pt-32 pb-24 bg-charcoal-950">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 space-y-12">
      
      <!-- Article Header -->
      <div class="space-y-4 border-b border-white/10 pb-8">
        <div class="flex items-center space-x-2 text-xs text-stone-400 font-mono">
          <a href="/articles" class="hover:text-gold-400">← Research Hub</a>
          <span>/</span>
          <span class="text-gold-400">Locality Dossier</span>
          <span>/</span>
          <span>Updated Sept 2026</span>
        </div>

        <h1 class="font-serif text-3xl sm:text-5xl font-bold text-stone-100 leading-tight">
          Mahalunge Pune Pin Code 411045: <br />
          <span class="gold-gradient-text">Complete Infrastructure & Connectivity Blueprint</span>
        </h1>

        <p class="text-stone-300 text-sm sm:text-base font-light leading-relaxed">
          The essential location dossier covering postal codes, taluka demarcation, the 36-meter PMRDA DP road network, the Hinjewadi-Mahalunge bridge, and Pune Metro Line 3 integration.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Quick Facts Locality Card -->
      <div class="p-6 sm:p-8 rounded-2xl bg-charcoal-900 border border-white/10 grid grid-cols-2 sm:grid-cols-4 gap-6">
        <div>
          <div class="text-[10px] uppercase tracking-widest text-stone-400">Postal Pin Code</div>
          <div class="font-mono text-xl sm:text-2xl font-bold text-gold-400 mt-1">411045</div>
          <div class="text-[10px] text-stone-500 mt-0.5">Head Post Office: Baner</div>
        </div>
        <div>
          <div class="text-[10px] uppercase tracking-widest text-stone-400">Administrative Taluka</div>
          <div class="font-mono text-xl sm:text-2xl font-bold text-stone-100 mt-1">Mulshi</div>
          <div class="text-[10px] text-stone-500 mt-0.5">District: Pune, Maharashtra</div>
        </div>
        <div>
          <div class="text-[10px] uppercase tracking-widest text-stone-400">Governing Body</div>
          <div class="font-mono text-xl sm:text-2xl font-bold text-emerald-400 mt-1">PMRDA</div>
          <div class="text-[10px] text-stone-500 mt-0.5">Town Planning Scheme 1</div>
        </div>
        <div>
          <div class="text-[10px] uppercase tracking-widest text-stone-400">Geo Coordinates</div>
          <div class="font-mono text-xs sm:text-sm font-bold text-stone-200 mt-2">18.5714° N</div>
          <div class="font-mono text-xs sm:text-sm font-bold text-stone-200">73.7432° E</div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Article Content -->
      <div class="prose prose-invert max-w-none space-y-8 text-stone-300 text-sm leading-relaxed">
        
        <section class="space-y-3">
          <h2 class="font-serif text-2xl text-stone-100 font-bold">
            1. Geographic Demarcation of Mahalunge (411045)
          </h2>
          <p>
            Mahalunge is situated in Mulshi Taluka of Pune District, bounded by the <strong>Mula River</strong> to the west, <strong>Balewadi</strong> and <strong>Baner</strong> to the east, and <strong>Hinjewadi IT Park</strong> to the northwest. Its strategic postal code <strong>411045</strong> places it within the same prestigious delivery zone as Baner and Balewadi, sharing established telecom, fiber-optic, and institutional postal logistics.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section class="space-y-3">
          <h2 class="font-serif text-2xl text-stone-100 font-bold">
            2. The 36-Meter PMRDA Arterial DP Road: Eliminating Bottlenecks
          </h2>
          <p>
            The signature infrastructure spine of Mahalunge is the <strong>36-meter wide Development Plan (DP) Road</strong> conceived under PMRDA's Town Planning Scheme 1. Unlike traditional Pune roads that suffered from irregular bottlenecks, this planned corridor features:
          </p>
          <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-2 text-stone-400">
            <li><strong>6-Lane Dual Carriageway:</strong> Engineered for 60 km/h traffic design capacity, dramatically speeding transit between Hinjewadi Phase 1 and Balewadi.</li>
            <li><strong>Dedicated Cycle & Pedestrian Green Corridors:</strong> Tree-shaded footpaths separated from motorized lanes for enhanced pedestrian safety.</li>
            <li><strong>Underground Utility Ducts:</strong> Pre-installed chambers for electrical cables, high-speed broadband, piped gas (PNG), and stormwater runoff, eliminating recurring road-digging.</li>
          </ul>
        </section>

        <section class="space-y-3">
          <h2 class="font-serif text-2xl text-stone-100 font-bold">
            3. The Mahalunge–Hinjewadi Phase 1 Mula River Bridge
          </h2>
          <p>
            Historically, commuters traveling from Mahalunge to Hinjewadi had to navigate around the Wakad flyover or Radha Chowk bottleneck. The <strong>Mula River connecting bridge</strong> creates a direct physical lifeline linking Mahalunge directly into <strong>Hinjewadi Phase 1 (near Quadron Business Park / Infosys circle)</strong> in under 7 minutes.
          </p>
          <p>
            For tech professionals, this direct bridge converts a previously stressful 35-minute commute into a brisk, peaceful 5-to-7 minute drive or bicycle ride.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section class="space-y-3">
          <h2 class="font-serif text-2xl text-stone-100 font-bold">
            4. Pune Metro Line 3 (Hinjewadi – Shivajinagar) Connectivity
          </h2>
          <p>
            The elevated <strong>Pune Metro Line 3</strong> (developed via PPP model by TRIL Urban Transport and Siemens) features 23 stations connecting Megapolis Circle in Hinjewadi Phase 3 straight to Civil Court, Shivajinagar.
          </p>
          <div class="p-6 rounded-xl bg-charcoal-900 border border-white/10 space-y-3">
            <h4 class="font-serif text-base font-semibold text-gold-400">Nearest Metro Stations to Mahindra Mahalunge:</h4>
            <ul class="space-y-2 text-xs text-stone-300">
              <li class="flex items-center justify-between border-b border-white/5 pb-2">
                <span>✦ Hinjewadi Phase 1 Station</span>
                <span class="font-mono text-stone-400">~2.8 km (6-8 mins)</span>
              </li>
              <li class="flex items-center justify-between border-b border-white/5 pb-2">
                <span>✦ Balewadi Stadium Station</span>
                <span class="font-mono text-stone-400">~3.5 km (8-10 mins)</span>
              </li>
              <li class="flex items-center justify-between">
                <span>✦ Wakad Chowk Interchange</span>
                <span class="font-mono text-stone-400">~4.8 km (10-12 mins)</span>
              </li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </section>

        <section class="space-y-3">
          <h2 class="font-serif text-2xl text-stone-100 font-bold">
            5. Pune Ring Road Integration & Regional Accessibility
          </h2>
          <p>
            The planned <strong>Pune Inner & Outer Ring Road networks</strong> pass within short driving proximity of the Nande–Mahalunge–Maan cluster. Once operational, the ring road will allow residents to bypass central Pune congestion entirely, providing uninterrupted high-speed bypass routes to Chakan Auto Hub, Talegaon MIDC, the Mumbai-Pune Expressway, and the upcoming Purandar International Airport.
          </p>
        </section>

      </div>

      <!-- Mahindra Land Parcel Context -->
      <div class="p-8 rounded-2xl bg-charcoal-900 border border-white/10 space-y-4">
        <span class="text-xs uppercase tracking-widest text-gold-400 font-bold">Landmark Development</span>
        <h3 class="font-serif text-2xl text-stone-100 font-bold">
          Mahindra Lifespaces' 13.46-Acre Acquisition in Nande-Mahalunge
        </h3>
        <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-300 leading-relaxed">
          Announced in October 2025 with an estimated ₹3,500 Crore development potential, Mahindra’s parcel occupies one of the finest topographic positions in Mahalunge—boasting clean hillside elevations, natural micro-climate breezes from the Western Ghats foothills, and immediate connectivity to the PMRDA DP arterial road.
        </p>
        <div class="pt-2 flex flex-wrap gap-4">
          <button
            type="button"
            data-open-modal
            data-interest="Mahalunge Infrastructure & Location Dossier"
            class="px-6 py-3 rounded-full bg-gradient-to-r from-gold-400 via-gold-500 to-gold-400 text-charcoal-950 font-bold text-xs uppercase tracking-wider hover:shadow-xl active:scale-95 transition-all"
          >
            Download Full Locality Dossier PDF
          </button>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>
  </article>
</Layout>
